		<title type="html"><![CDATA[terminating connection because of crash of another server process]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=5937#p5937"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>voivi ma requete chaque fois cela part en erreur<br />que puis je faire <br />merci</p><p>update info p1 set<br />&#160; do_zps&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;= p2.do_zps ,<br />&#160; a_do_zps_am&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;= cast(substr(p2.d_desig_am,7,4) as integer)<br />&#160; from zenvipaca.do_zps_paca p2<br />&#160; where<br />&#160; p1.the_geom &amp;&amp; p2.the_geom AND<br />&#160; intersects(p1.the_geom,p2.the_geom)&#160; ;</p><p>WARNING:&#160; terminating connection because of crash of another server process<br />DETAIL:&#160; The postmaster has commanded this server process to roll back the current transaction and exit, because another server process exited abnormally and possibly corrupted shared memory.<br />HINT:&#160; In a moment you should be able to reconnect to the database and repeat your command.</p>]]></content>
